%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dw-core-functions-unzip (関数ページ)
doc と相違 (doc の Output と実 DW の出力の値が一致しない)
doc の Output:
  [0,1,2,3]
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/json
---
unzip([ [0,"a"], [1,"a","foo"], [2], [3,"a"] ])
%%% output application/json
[
  [
    0,
    1,
    2,
    3
  ]
]
